{"4916140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FKC: Fighting Krazy Chickens!", "steam_appid": 4916140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4994390], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/7ed2b7bc080845bb9ebc23c0b2508349.avif?t=1785430734\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras_big/7ed2b7bc080845bb9ebc23c0b2508349.avif?t=1785430734 width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to FKC: Fighting Krazy Chickens!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The survivor-like where the enemies are your bullets. Grab chickens, throw them into massive hordes and unleash absurd chain reactions as the battlefield spirals completely out of control. Fight endless waves, unlock ridiculous upgrades and embrace the chaos in this fast-paced action bullet heaven where every run becomes a completely different disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Peck. Destroy. Embrace the chaos.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THROW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab chickens straight from the battlefield and launch them back into the horde. Every chicken is a tool for your survival. Experiment with different chicken types, discover their effects and learn how to weaponize their absolute nonsense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Throw until you can throw no more!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/7e9102feee5774438ba4abf7f8b54401.poster.avif?t=1785430734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/7e9102feee5774438ba4abf7f8b54401.webm?t=1785430734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/7e9102feee5774438ba4abf7f8b54401.mp4?t=1785430734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from dozens of upgrades and transform the way you fight. Throw farther, hit harder, dash your way out of the flock and combine abilities to create increasingly absurd synergies. Every upgrade is a step closer to mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Throw them harder. Better. Faster. Stronger.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/f89ca221ee12bd4f596d1e9fd0558f9d.poster.avif?t=1785430734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/f89ca221ee12bd4f596d1e9fd0558f9d.webm?t=1785430734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/f89ca221ee12bd4f596d1e9fd0558f9d.mp4?t=1785430734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless waves of increasingly dangerous chickens. One bad throw and you could be out, but aim at the perfect spot, and you'll wipe out the entire screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just keep throwing, just keep throwing…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/93e9d2e34d1e3fd97d23142acb6229e9.poster.avif?t=1785430734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/93e9d2e34d1e3fd97d23142acb6229e9.webm?t=1785430734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/93e9d2e34d1e3fd97d23142acb6229e9.mp4?t=1785430734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the flock alone or bring backup. More players mean more explosions, more chaos and way more chickens flying across the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait, there is more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey content creators, don’t have any friends to play with? Don’t worry, FKC features Twitch integration! But maybe the “help” from your newly gained “friends” won’t be as friendly as one might think…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The flock never stops. Bring backup.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/743c81e29a53ae412abe96b523ac915f.poster.avif?t=1785430734\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/743c81e29a53ae412abe96b523ac915f.webm?t=1785430734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/743c81e29a53ae412abe96b523ac915f.mp4?t=1785430734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class