amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/743c81e29a53ae412abe96b523ac915f.mp4?t=1785430734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras/4a9f7c0c2b01864cd0a4199c49882e19.avif?t=1785430734\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/extras_big/4a9f7c0c2b01864cd0a4199c49882e19.avif?t=1785430734 width=1560 height=218 /></span></p>", "short_description": "They broke his egg... He took it personally. How much revenge does an egg deserve? Join forces with Kraze in this comedic survivor-like where the enemies are your bullets. Turn chickens into weapons, survive endless chicken hordes, upgrade your chicken and fight... Way too many chickens!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/73bf15ded002ce4074c5602d15d1bf8642cf9075/header.jpg?t=1785430734", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/1e9704dcbc7ba5f42fe1bc91dfc02d3ae96f4cf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785430734", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916140/1e9704dcbc7ba5f42fe1bc91dfc02d3ae96f4cf1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785430734", "website": "https://sunblindgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I3-7100 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum requirements for playing at 720p@30fps</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><s